Subject: Re: CFA on non-normal ordinal data
Message-ID: <VNEcX72Q_qU.vDuHY_o1AwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <VNEcX72Q_qU.7XxQ-0UWAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
